==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=nl|/lɪxt/}}
* {{audio|Nl-licht.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}
* {{homophones|lang=nl|ligt}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|licht}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*līht}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*linhtaz}}, ultimately from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*h₁lengʷʰ-}}. Compare English {{m|en|light}}, German {{m|de|leicht}}, Danish {{m|da|let}}.

====Adjective====
{{nl-adj}}

# [[light]], of little weight
# {{lb|nl|metonymy}} [[easy]], [[mild]]

=====Inflection=====
{{nl-decl-adj}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|nl|zwaar}}
* {{l|nl|gewichtig}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nl|lichtelijk}}
* {{l|nl|lichtjes}}
* {{l|nl|lichtmatroos}}
* {{l|nl|verlichten}}

===Etymology 2===
{{PIE root|nl|lewk}}
From {{inh|nl|dum|licht}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|lioht}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*leuhtą}}, from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*lewk-||light; bright; to shine}}.

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|n|-en|lichtje}}

# A [[light]], illumination
# A light [[source]]
# {{lb|nl|metonymy}} [[inspiration]] (in ''z'n licht opsteken''); a bright [[mind]]
#* '''1992''', [[w:A. F. Th. van der Heijden|A. F. Th. van der Heijden]], ''Weerborstels'', Em. Querido's Uitgeverij, page 52:
#*: Geen groot '''licht''', die Bossche voddendief, maar ik deed het ermee.
#*:: No genius, that rag thief from Den Bosch, but I made do with it.

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nl|belichten}}
* {{l|nl|lichtbron}}
* {{l|nl|lichtinval}}
* {{l|nl|lichtpunt}}

