From {{inh|nl|dum|licht}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|lioht}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*leuhtaz}}, from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*lewk-||light; bright; to shine}}.

====Adjective====
{{nl-adj}}

# [[light]], [[bright]]

